Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:29.41,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 ATP1000 半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:29.41,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}菲斯 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}3 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}4{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 科博利 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.39,0:00:03.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Arthur, thanks for joining us inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.39,0:00:03.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,亚瑟 谢谢你进来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.28,0:00:05.80,EN,,0,0,0,,The rain came at a bad time there,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.28,0:00:05.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,那场雨来得不是时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:07.47,EN,,0,0,0,,but you had time to finish the match
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:07.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过你还是把比赛打完了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.47,0:00:08.16,EN,,0,0,0,,and what a match.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.47,0:00:08.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且打得很精彩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.16,0:00:09.38,EN,,0,0,0,,Give us an idea of the focus
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.16,0:00:09.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,说说你保持专注
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:10.95,EN,,0,0,0,,that you brought to court today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:10.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天在场上是怎么做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.95,0:00:12.35,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was very happy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.95,0:00:12.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,我对这场表现
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.35,0:00:13.87,EN,,0,0,0,,with the performance, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.35,0:00:13.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常满意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.87,0:00:15.47,EN,,0,0,0,,We start, I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.87,0:00:15.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,开局的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.47,0:00:19.07,EN,,0,0,0,,I start pretty slow, I was a bit tight,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.47,0:00:19.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,我打得比较慢 有点紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.07,0:00:21.95,EN,,0,0,0,,but I think from 4-3 in the first set
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.07,0:00:21.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我觉得第一盘四比三之后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.95,0:00:24.19,EN,,0,0,0,,when I won those tough and long rallies,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.95,0:00:24.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,拿下了那几个又长又难的球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.19,0:00:26.56,EN,,0,0,0,,then just the momentum got my way
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.19,0:00:26.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,势头就转到我这边了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.56,0:00:29.59,EN,,0,0,0,,and I felt way better, especially on the serve,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.56,0:00:29.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉好了很多 尤其是发球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.59,0:00:30.55,EN,,0,0,0,,because the first couple
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.59,0:00:30.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为一开始几局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.55,0:00:32.47,EN,,0,0,0,,of games I didn't serve good at all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.55,0:00:32.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,我发球状态很差
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.47,0:00:34.87,EN,,0,0,0,,and then after was very good, so yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.47,0:00:34.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,后来就好起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.87,0:00:36.47,EN,,0,0,0,,very happy with the performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.87,0:00:36.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场表现我挺满意的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.47,0:00:38.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Tight at the start, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.47,0:00:38.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,你说开局有点紧张？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:39.46,EN,,0,0,0,,The significance of the match, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:39.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,加上比赛的分量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.46,0:00:40.99,EN,,0,0,0,,and then the delay at the beginning?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.46,0:00:40.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有开局那场中断？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.99,0:00:42.55,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you know, it's not easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.99,0:00:42.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 确实不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.55,0:00:44.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Like, I came out on the court, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.55,0:00:44.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我上场的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.84,0:00:46.78,EN,,0,0,0,,it's a semi-final, you're a bit more nervous,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.84,0:00:46.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,毕竟是半决赛 会更紧张一点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.78,0:00:48.40,EN,,0,0,0,,but then after the rain arrived,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.78,0:00:48.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,但后来雨一来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.40,0:00:49.53,EN,,0,0,0,,then you got away,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.40,0:00:49.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,你就先离场了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.53,0:00:51.99,EN,,0,0,0,,then after you come back and the ball,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.53,0:00:51.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,回来之后 球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.99,0:00:53.91,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, the conditions
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.99,0:00:53.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有场地条件
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.91,0:00:56.55,EN,,0,0,0,,are completely different and everything
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.91,0:00:56.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,都完全变了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.55,0:00:58.85,EN,,0,0,0,,and all together was a bit tough
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.55,0:00:58.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,整体上是有点难应付
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.85,0:01:01.14,EN,,0,0,0,,to deal with, but I'm pretty happy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.85,0:01:01.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过我挺满意
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.14,0:01:02.43,EN,,0,0,0,,with the way I manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.14,0:01:02.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,自己处理的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.43,0:01:04.11,EN,,0,0,0,,You're up to six in the race,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.43,0:01:04.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,你现在总决赛落点第六了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.11,0:01:05.55,EN,,0,0,0,,I think now, and you've got
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.11,0:01:05.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且你还有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.55,0:01:07.62,EN,,0,0,0,,this big final ahead tomorrow, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.55,0:01:07.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,明天这场重要的决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.31,EN,,0,0,0,,How big a step is this in your career?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,这对你的生涯是多大一步？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.31,0:01:12.89,EN,,0,0,0,,I need to focus still on the tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.31,0:01:12.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,我还是想先专注这站比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.89,0:01:15.88,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, of course, six in the race is cool,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.89,0:01:15.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,进前六当然很酷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.88,0:01:17.72,EN,,0,0,0,,I have a final to play tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.88,0:01:17.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,但明天还有决赛要打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.72,0:01:20.23,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna try to bring the title at home,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.72,0:01:20.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,我会争取把冠军留在主场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.23,0:01:23.23,EN,,0,0,0,,to go in New York with a lot of confidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.23,0:01:23.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,带着信心去纽约
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.23,0:01:24.45,EN,,0,0,0,,and yeah, that's it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.23,0:01:24.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.45,0:01:26.50,EN,,0,0,0,,but still focus on the final tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.45,0:01:26.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,但还是先专注明天的决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.50,0:01:29.41,EN,,0,0,0,,Well done. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.50,0:01:29.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,说得漂亮 非常感谢
